FeatherCli for Debian
=====================

FeatherCli is the official FeatherPanel CLI and Pterodactyl/Pelican migration agent.
The binary is installed to `/usr/local/bin/feathercli`.

Quick start
-----------

1. Configure the panel URL and API key:

       feathercli config setup
       # or headless:
       # feathercli config set api_url https://panel.example.com
       # feathercli config set api_key YOUR_KEY

2. Migrate from Pterodactyl/Pelican:

       feathercli migrate --pterodactyl-dir /var/www/pterodactyl

Channels
--------

- `feathercli` — stable releases (GitHub `v*` tags with the panel)
- `feathercli-dev` — per-commit / nightly builds

These packages conflict with each other and cannot be installed together.

